OL,3,GNEWSATripling of river wall repair
OL,4,Abudget is approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FA proposal to triple the budget needed
OL,7,Fto repair a failing river wall has been
OL,8,Fapproved by councillors.
OL,10,FA section of the wall next to Jesus
OL,11,FGreen Lock in Cambridge has been slowly
OL,12,Fdeteriorating in recent years, forcing
OL,13,Fits partial closure in July for safety
OL,14,Freasons.
OL,16,FCity councillors backed a
OL,17,Frecommendation to increase the maximum
OL,18,Fbudget to #2.44m, up from the previous
OL,19,Ffigure of #850,000 agreed in October
OL,20,F2024.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
