OL,3,GNEWSATripling of river wall repair
OL,4,Abudget is approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FMartin Smart, Labour cabinet member for
OL,7,Fnature, open space and city services,
OL,8,Fsaid the lower figure was an "early
OL,9,Fcost estimate" based on doing the work
OL,10,Ffrom land.
